 you log thirty five kroner for groceries in Enow? I paid for it.\", \"thirty five kroner groceries, Enow, I paid\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0016\", \"v\": [[\"pics from this month?\"], [\"what pics do i have from this month\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0017\", \"v\": [[\"met Faustina for coffee today, log it pls\", \"diff thing, whats left to do on the cancel plan\", \"the clean one's done\", \"oh and did i bin the magnolia document?\"], [\"Could you please log that I met Faustina for coffee today?\", \"On a different note, could you tell me what's still left to do on the cancel plan?\", \"Thank you. Please mark the clean one as done.\", \"Also, could you tell me whether I binned the magnolia document?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0018\", \"v\": [[\"saw Faustina Alcott for coffee today, log it pls\"], [\"Could you please log that I met Faustina Alcott for coffee today?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0019\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me where I stand with Tonu in the number 88 flat, please?\", \"Tonu, number 88 flat balance?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0020\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who Faustina is, please?\", \"The Pickersgill one, please: when is their birthday?\", \"On another note, could you show me what I wrote this month in my journal?\", \"Could you please pull up Bethan's contact card?\", \"Which events are they coming to, please?\", \"Actually, no, please just leave it.\"], [\"who's Faustina?\", \"Pickersgill one's birthday?\", \"what I wrote this month, journal\", \"Bethan's contact card\", \"events they're coming to?\", \"nah, leave it\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0021\", \"v\": [[\"last week diary entries\", \"anyone owe me money?\", \"Sathette one's contact details\", \"pics from Mill\", \"how many's that?\"], [\"show me what i wrote last week in my diary pls\", \"diff q, does anyone owe me cash\", \"can i get the Sathette one's contact details\", \"ok now my pics from Mill\", \"how many is that\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0022\", \"v\": [[\"who's in the Enow trip group?\", \"actually, don't bother\"], [\"Could you list the people in the Enow trip group, please?\", \"Actually, please don't bother with that, thank you.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0023\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me where the funnel close-up went, please?\", \"Thank you. Which album is it in?\", \"On another matter, could you tell me what Gristine's balance with me is in the Enow group?\"], [\"umm where did the funnel close-up go?\", \"oh ok and which album's it, uh, in?\", \"uh different thing, what's Gristine's… like her balance with me in the Enow group?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0024\", \"v\": [[\"can the renew task go to friday instead\", \"also did i delete the giraffe document\", \"hang on what've i got filed under Travel\", \"wait quick one, whats left to do on the cancel plan\", \"ok back to the giraffe thing, can u add a task to check the giraffe document monday\"], [\"Could the renew task be moved to friday instead, please?\", \"Separately, could you tell me whether I deleted the giraffe document?\", \"Hang on, could you show me what I have filed under Travel?\", \"Sorry, one quick question first: what's left to do on the cancel plan?\", \"Going back to the giraffe one, could you please create a task to check the giraffe document on monday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0025\", \"v\": [[\"I'm clearing out old paperwork I don't need anymore, so could you delete the ladle policy document for me? It's just cluttering things up.\"], [\"pls delete the ladle policy document\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0026\", \"v\": [[\"delete the giraffe document pls\", \"diff thing, whats the steps for replace the woodpecker this week\", \"how much did the naxos garden cost\", \"make the bassoon one an hour later\"], [\"Could you please delete the giraffe document?\", \"Could you tell me what the steps are for replace the woodpecker this week?\", \"Also, how much did the naxos garden cost, please?\", \"Would you mind making the bassoon one an hour later?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0027\", \"v\": [[\"photograph to-dos?\"], [\"any photograph stuff in my to-dos\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w21-0028\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who I currently owe money to?\", \"Also, could you please delete everything in the vault?\"], [\"who do i owe money to rn\", \"diff thing, wipe everything in the vault pls\"]]}","ttft_ms":23533,"type":"result","duration_ms":35185,"uuid":"0a60a7c8-70ce-4fe2-95c9-bfcbcbeff33f","ttft_stream_ms":1358,"time_to_request_ms":123,"first_content_frame_ms":1358,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22213655,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278764052.392,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
